TI  - DynaFormer: A Dynamic Dual-Attention Transformer with Linear-Complexity Fusion for Medical Image Segmentation
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 IEEE Conference on Artificial Intelligence, CAI 2026
SP  - 1518
EP  - 1523
DO  - 10.1109/CAI68641.2026.11536230
