TI  - Data Modalities and ML/DL Techniques for Crop Disease Detection and Epidemiological Forecasting: A Systematic Review
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 International Conference on Intelligent Systems and Digital Applications, ISDA 2026 - Proceedings
